---
// "BEHIND THE WORK" - large bio text, dark background, no image
---

<section id="about" class="behind-work" aria-labelledby="behind-work-title">
  <div class="behind-work__inner">
    <p id="behind-work-title" class="behind-work__eyebrow" data-scramble="scroll">Behind the work</p>
    <p class="behind-work__copy">
      Ugnius Liberman is a data scientist, AI engineer, and photographer based in Kaunas, Lithuania. He builds systems that sit at the intersection of the visual and the technical - driven by curiosity, expression, utility.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .behind-work {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #08090a;
    color: #f4f3f0;
    padding:
      clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem)
      clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 4rem)
      clamp(6rem, 12vw, 10rem);
  }

  .behind-work__inner {
    width: min(100%, 100rem);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .behind-work__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    color: var(--color-accent-soft);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.35rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .behind-work__copy {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-reading);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.5vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.88);
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .behind-work {
      padding-block: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6rem) clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6rem);
    }

    .behind-work__copy {
      font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 5.5vw, 2rem);
      line-height: 1.45;
      letter-spacing: normal;
    }
  }
</style>
